<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential cuts First USA.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential cuts First USA.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities downgraded First USA Inc to hold from buy, a Prudential source said.</p>
<p>-- On Monday Banc One Corp said it was acquiring First USA in a stock deal.</p>
<p>-- First USA ended Monday up 8-7/8 to 45-5/8.</p>
</text>
